Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:47:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Concept: irreducible characters trivial on a subgroup
 (irrTrivialOn)

Two files defined the set of irreducible characters whose kernel contains a
subgroup N, once at top level and once in OneBlockRestriction, each with its
own membership lemmas. Keep the top-level definition and put next to it the
fact that an integer combination of such characters is constant on N, which
was also proved twice; point every use at them.

Made by Claude Code (AI).
